  "label": "Police Officer Stereotype",
  "description": "A stereotype that portrays police officers as inherently dangerous, aggressive, or prone to using excessive force, especially against civilians. This stereotype is often used in memes to create a sense of fear or to justify violence. The meme uses the officer's friendly expression to contrast with the violent message, reinforcing the stereotype that police can be unpredictable and dangerous.",
